Band Description: A trio of multi-instrumentalists who live in the ship’s sub-deck. They perform standing inside translucent, recycled oxygen-scrubber tanks, manipulating modular synths that are physically wired into the ship’s navigation mainframe, ensuring the rhythm fluctuates whenever the ship shifts course.

